sequenceDiagram
    participant You as You
    participant App as Gallery
    participant Engine as Mermaid
    participant Art as Artwork
    You->>App: Choose a diagram
    activate App
    App->>Engine: Send the source
    activate Engine
    Note over Engine: A little bit of magic
    Engine-->>App: Draw the diagram
    deactivate Engine
    App->>Art: Create vector artwork
    Art-->>You: Ready to share
    deactivate App
